<section id="sec-home" class="sec">
  <div class="home-hero">
    <div class="home-eyebrow">聖母健康農莊・戶外教學體驗課程</div>
    <div class="home-title">香藥草體驗課程</div>
    <div class="home-sub">三套獨立課程・各 50 分鐘</div>
    <div class="course-cards">
